{"id":10472,"artist":"The Beatles","title":"In My Life","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:09.00] There are places I'll remember\n[00:13.80] all my life though some have changed.\n[00:18.60] Some forever not for better.\n[00:23.40] Some have gone and some remain.\n[00:28.20] All these places have their moments\n[00:33.30] with lovers and friends I still can recall.\n[00:37.80] Some are dead and some are living.\n[00:42.90] In my life I've loved them all!\n[00:57.00] But of all these friends and lovers\n[01:01.80] there is no one compares with you.\n[01:06.60] And these memories loose their meaning\n[01:11.40] when I think of love as something new.\n[01:16.20] Though I know I'll never loose affection\n[01:21.30] for people and things that went before.\n[01:25.80] I know I'll often stop and think about them.\n[01:30.90] In my life I love you more!\n[01:54.60] Though I know I'll never loose affection\n[01:59.70] for people and things that went before.\n[02:04.20] I know I'll often stop and think about them.\n[02:09.30] In my life I love you more!\n[02:18.90] In my life I love you more!\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:09.00] <00:09.00>There <00:09.29>are <00:09.59>pla <00:10.19>ces <00:10.79>I'll <00:11.40>re <00:12.00>mem <00:12.29>ber\n[00:13.79] <00:13.79>all <00:14.09>my <00:14.39>life <00:15.29>tho <00:15.44>u <00:15.59>gh <00:16.50>some <00:16.80>have <00:17.39>chang <00:17.69>ed.\n[00:18.59] <00:18.59>Some <00:18.89>for <00:19.19>e <00:19.80>ver <00:20.39>not <00:21.00>for <00:21.59>bet <00:21.89>ter.\n[00:23.39] <00:23.39>Some <00:23.69>have <00:24.00>g <00:24.89>o <00:25.05>n <00:25.19>e <00:26.09>and <00:26.39>some <00:27.00>re <00:27.30>main.\n[00:28.19] <00:28.19>All <00:28.50>the <00:28.79>se <00:29.09>pla <00:29.39>ces <00:29.69>ha <00:30.00>ve <00:30.29>th <00:30.59>e <00:30.89>ir <00:31.19>mo <00:31.50>ments\n[00:33.29] <00:33.29>with <00:33.60>lov <00:33.89>ers <00:34.19>and <00:34.50>friends <00:35.69>I <00:36.00>still <00:36.29>can <00:36.60>re